WEBVTT

00:00:02.767 --> 00:00:09.133 line:75% position:67% align:start size:30%
Open Settings.
The sidebar footer keeps account and device preferences together.

00:00:09.133 --> 00:00:15.400 line:15% position:3% align:start size:30%
Review your profile.
Profile settings separates personal preferences from mapped accounts.

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:18.467 line:75% position:3% align:start size:30%
Return to device preferences.
Close the profile without changing its saved information.

00:00:18.467 --> 00:00:24.733 line:15% position:3% align:start size:30%
Make the text easier to read.
Medium increases companion text by 15%. Watch the labels change.

00:00:24.733 --> 00:00:30.500 line:75% position:3% align:start size:30%
Choose the mascot size.
Small scales the companion art, not your task text.

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:40.150 line:15% position:3% align:start size:30%
Keep the size that suits you.
These display preferences apply immediately and are remembered locally.
